Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Owner rulings, 2026-11-13 (cards in the merge manager's session, about
21:24Z; "update processes / skills / tools"):
- "A. MM dispatches, auto-merge OK": only the merge manager dispatches a
  standing re-pin; its auto-merge on green is the merge manager's merge;
  a cron or repository_dispatch trigger, if kept, only opens the PR.
- "A. Give MM access": the merge manager attaches each site repository
  and runs its re-pin (dispatch, approve held bot runs, merge when green).
- A one-time consent is quoted in the re-pin PR body and in trust.consent
  evidence (folio-assistant#3119, "A. Re-point to main").
- Held bot-pushed re-pin runs (action_required) are approved by the merge
  manager.
In merge-manager-watcher §"Only the merge manager merges and re-pins"
(items 4-6) and remote-mount (§"Standing consent", §"Trust").

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
